# Astra library - not needed for website deploy
# =========================================================
# Option 2: Use this ONLY if you deploy from repo root WITHOUT setting Root Directory.
# If you use Root Directory = website (Option 1, recommended), Vercel only uploads
# website/ anyway and this file is ignored. Kept as fallback safety net.
#
# To use Option 1 (recommended): Vercel Dashboard -> Settings -> General -> Root Directory -> website
# Then delete or keep this file - it won't affect Root Directory builds.

# Luau source - library bundle + modules
*.luau
!website/**/*.luau

# Library folders
components/
elements/
core/
settings/
themes/
icons/
utilities/
images/
cache/
layouts/
functions/
scripts/
skills/
assets/

# Rojo / Luau project config (not needed for web)
default.project.json
wax.project.json

# Docs that are library-only (optional - remove ! if you want them in deploy)
# CHANGELOG.md
# MODULES.md

# Keep the website itself
!website/
!website/**
